# Selecting Digital Electronic Knowledge: A Process Model.

**Authors:** Barrette, Pierre P.

## Abstract
Presents a model for the evaluation and selection of instructional software packages for microcomputers by school librarians and media specialists. Types of educational applications for microcomputers, the analysis of printed documentation decribing instructional software, content analysis, default analysis, operant analysis, and access time are discussed. (JL)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ264806

